# ==============================================================================
# CODEOWNERS — Aegis Forge
# ==============================================================================
# Every path below requires review from its listed owner(s) before merge.
# Combined with branch protection (see SETUP.md §Branch Protection), this
# enforces Segregation of Duties on security-sensitive surfaces.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles with real GitHub users/teams in derived
# projects. Syntax:  <pattern>  <owner> [<owner>...]
# ==============================================================================

# Default owner for anything not matched below
*                                           @org/maintainers

# Security policy, IAM, access matrix, threat models — Security lead must review
/docs/security/                             @org/security-lead
/docs/security-iam-policy.md                @org/security-lead
/docs/security-access-matrix.md             @org/security-lead
/docs/adr/                                  @org/security-lead @org/maintainers
SECURITY.md                                 @org/security-lead

# CI/CD & DevSecOps pipeline — DevOps lead must review (protects the supply chain)
/.github/workflows/                         @org/devops-lead
/.github/dependabot.yml                     @org/devops-lead
/.gitleaks.toml                             @org/devops-lead @org/security-lead
/.pre-commit-config.yaml                    @org/devops-lead
/scripts/                                   @org/devops-lead
/docker-compose.yml                         @org/devops-lead

# Data layer — DBA / data owner must review schema & migrations
/docs/schema.sql                            @org/dba-lead
/docs/schema-template.sql                   @org/dba-lead

# API contract — backend/API owner must review
/docs/openapi.yaml                          @org/api-lead
/docs/openapi-template.yaml                 @org/api-lead
